Docklands

Docklands is a community fork of the upstream project at:

    https://github.com/dokploy/dokploy

The original upstream project and its contributors retain copyright in their
contributions. Docklands contributors retain copyright in their modifications.

This repository is intended to contain Apache-2.0-compatible code only. Upstream
source-available/proprietary components and commercial license-server plumbing
have been removed. Minimal disabled compatibility shims may remain where needed
to keep open application flows compiling while replacement features are designed.
